#: includes/class-distribution.php:288
msgid ""
"Submit your podcast feed to each platform once; after that they pick up "
"every new episode by themselves. They are ordered by importance. Mark each "
"one as you go, so you can see at a glance where your podcast is still "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"Envía el feed de tu podcast a cada plataforma una sola vez; a partir de ahí "
"recogen solas cada episodio nuevo. Están ordenadas por importancia. Marca "
"cada una según avances, para ver de un vistazo dónde falta todavía tu "
"podcast."

#: includes/class-distribution.php:294
msgid "Podcast:"
msgstr "Podcast:"

